OL,6,
OL,7,FThe media personality faces seven
OL,8,Fcharges - three counts of rape, three
OL,9,Fcounts of sexual assault and one of
OL,10,Fattempted indecent assault. He denies
OL,11,Fall the charges and has pleaded not
OL,12,Fguilty.
